---
const { zh } = Astro.props;
---
    <!-- ===== STRUCTURE ===== -->
    <div class="page" id="page-structure">
      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-title">{zh ? "交互式结构查看器" : "Interactive Structure Viewer"}</div>
        <div class="card-desc">{zh ? "支持 PDB / mmCIF 蛋白质结构交互式查看（桌面版：旋转、缩放、残基选择、距离测量、图片导出）。以下为经典案例模拟演示——血红蛋白（Hemoglobin，1HHO）的氧合与一氧化碳结合机制。" : "Interactive PDB/mmCIF protein viewer (desktop: rotate, zoom, residue selection, distance measurement, image export). Simulated classic case below — hemoglobin (1HHO) oxygenation and carbon-monoxide binding."}</div>
      </div>

      <div class="card">
        <div class="card-title">🧊 {zh ? "真实 3D 结构（WebGL 渲染）" : "Real 3D Structures (WebGL)"}</div>
        <div class="card-desc">{zh ? "在浏览器中实时渲染 PDB 原子坐标（3Dmol.js）：人血红蛋白 1HHO（α₂β₂ 四聚体 · 4 个血红素）与牛胰岛素 4INS（A/B 双链 · 受体结合位点高亮动画）。拖拽旋转 · 滚轮缩放 · 自动缓慢旋转。" : "Real-time PDB rendering in browser (3Dmol.js): human hemoglobin 1HHO (α₂β₂ tetramer · 4 hemes) and bovine insulin 4INS (A/B chains · receptor-binding sites with flash animation). Drag to rotate · scroll to zoom · slow auto-spin."}</div>
        <div class="mdl-tabs">
          <button class="mdl-tab active" data-mdl="hho" onclick="mdlSwitch('hho')">🩸 {zh ? "血红蛋白 1HHO" : "Hemoglobin 1HHO"}</button>
          <button class="mdl-tab" data-mdl="ins" onclick="mdlSwitch('ins')">💉 {zh ? "牛胰岛素 4INS" : "Bovine insulin 4INS"}</button>
        </div>
        <div class="mdl-viewer" id="mdl-viewer"></div>
        <div class="mdl-note" id="mdl-note"></div>
      </div>

      <div class="hb-wrap">
        <div class="hb-main">
          <div style="font-size:0.8125rem;font-weight:600;margin-bottom:0.75rem">{zh ? "血红蛋白四聚体" : "Hemoglobin Tetramer"}</div>
          <svg viewBox="0 0 300 240" width="100%" style="max-width:280px">
            <rect width="300" height="240" style="fill:var(--chart-bg)" rx="8"/>
            <ellipse cx="150" cy="120" rx="118" ry="88" fill="none" style="stroke:var(--chart-grid)" stroke-width="0.5"/>
            <!-- α1 α2 β1 β2 -->
            <ellipse cx="85" cy="70" rx="52" ry="38" fill="var(--brand-dark)" opacity="0.55" stroke="var(--brand-teal)" stroke-width="1.2"/>
            <ellipse cx="215" cy="70" rx="52" ry="38" fill="var(--brand-dark)" opacity="0.55" stroke="var(--brand-teal)" stroke-width="1.2"/>
            <ellipse cx="85" cy="170" rx="52" ry="38" fill="var(--brand-dark)" opacity="0.35" stroke="var(--brand-teal)" stroke-width="1.2"/>
            <ellipse cx="215" cy="170" rx="52" ry="38" fill="var(--brand-dark)" opacity="0.35" stroke="var(--brand-teal)" stroke-width="1.2"/>
            <text x="85" y="75" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:var(--text)" font-size="11" font-weight="700">α₁</text>
            <text x="215" y="75" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:var(--text)" font-size="11" font-weight="700">α₂</text>
            <text x="85" y="175" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:var(--text)" font-size="11" font-weight="700">β₁</text>
            <text x="215" y="175" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:var(--text)" font-size="11" font-weight="700">β₂</text>
            <!-- 血红素 -->
            <circle cx="85" cy="95" r="6" fill="#B06818"/><circle cx="215" cy="95" r="6" fill="#B06818"/>
            <circle cx="85" cy="145" r="6" fill="#B06818"/><circle cx="215" cy="145" r="6" fill="#B06818"/>
            <!-- 中央腔 -->
            <ellipse cx="150" cy="120" rx="34" ry="22" fill="none" stroke="var(--text-dim)" stroke-width="0.8" stroke-dasharray="3,3"/>
            <text x="150" y="118" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:var(--text-dim)" font-size="7">2,3-BPG</text>
            <text x="150" y="128" text-anchor="middle" style="fill:var(--text-dim)" font-size="7">{zh ? "腔" : "cavity"}</text>
          </svg>
          <div style="display:flex;gap:0.5rem;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:0.75rem">
            <span class="hb-badge">α₂β₂ · 4 × Heme (Fe²⁺)</span>
            <span class="hb-badge" id="hb-state-badge">{zh ? "脱氧 · T 态" : "Deoxy · T state"}</span>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="hb-scene">
          <svg id="hb-scene-svg" viewBox="0 0 420 260"></svg>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="hb-controls">
        <button class="hb-btn active" id="hb-btn-o2" onclick="hbScene('o2')">◉ {zh ? "O₂ 结合（氧合）" : "O₂ binding (oxygenation)"}</button>
        <button class="hb-btn" id="hb-btn-co" onclick="hbScene('co')">◍ {zh ? "CO 结合（碳氧血红蛋白）" : "CO binding (COHb)"}</button>
        <button class="hb-btn" id="hb-btn-compete" onclick="hbScene('compete')">⚡ {zh ? "CO 竞争结合（抢夺 O₂）" : "CO competition (steals O₂)"}</button>
      </div>
      <div class="hb-note" id="hb-note"></div>
    </div>
